ValueSet:   ValueSetAnatomicalRegion
Id:	        cz-anatomical-region-valueset
Title:	    "ValueSet: Anatomical Region"
Description:   """A shortlist of anatomical regions that can be used for searching reports and manifests. When the MADO manifest is implemented, this ValueSet can be replaced with a reference to that ValueSet."""
* ^experimental = false
* $sctCZ#63337009  // Lower trunk Abdominopelvic segment of trunk
* $sctCZ#38266002  // Whole body Entire body as a whole
* $sctCZ#53120007  // Arm Upper limb structure
* $sctCZ#61685007  // Leg Lower limb structure
* $sctCZ#67734004  // Upper trunk Thoracic segment of trunk
* $sctCZ#774007    // Head and neck* Structure of head and/or neck
* $sctCZ#113257007 // Cardiovascular system Structure of cardiovascular system
* $sctCZ#80891009  // Heart Heart
* $sctCZ#76752008  // Breast Breast structure
* $sctCZ#737561001 // Spine* Structure of vertebral column and/or spinal cord